{"sections":[{"slug":"唯一分解整环","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"唯一分解整环"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">唯一分解整环</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“唯一分解整环”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>$\\mathbb{Z}[\\sqrt{-5}]$ <span lang=\"zh\">不是唯一分解整环</span>: $6=2\\times 3 = (1+\\sqrt{-5})(1-\\sqrt{-5})$.</p>\n"}}}]}